answers.csv has no labelled rows. The evidence supports forcing escalation when tier_critical is 1 and error_rate is at least 0.700. The existing weights also remove tone_anger from the decision and add 20 to the logit for EU alerts.

I will preserve those edits and add a bounded ReLU correction. ReLU cannot make an exact jump at 0.700, so the edit will use a transition band less than 0.000000000015 wide below that threshold.

